\headery720\footery720\pgwsxn11906\pghsxn16838\marglsxn1440\margtsxn1440\margrsxn1440\margbsxn1440\pgbrdropt0\pard\ltrpar\itap0\nowidctlpar\ql\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\plain\rtlch\af1\afs20\alang0\ab\acf2\ltrch\f1\fs20\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\b\cf2 NORTHSTAR / PROJECT BRIEF\plain\rtlch\af1\afs20\alang0\acf2\ltrch\f1\fs20\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf2\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs44\alang0\ab\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs44\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\b\cf3 A clearer path forward\plain\rtlch\af1\afs44\alang0\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs44\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf3\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs20\alang0\acf4\ltrch\f1\fs20\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf4 Working draft | October 2026\par\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs23\alang0\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs23\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf3 We are launching a new customer onboarding experience to help teams get productive faster. Our goal is to reduce the average setup time from five days to two days while keeping customer satisfaction above 90 percent.\par\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs23\alang0\ab\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs23\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\b\cf3 What happens next\plain\rtlch\af1\afs23\alang0\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs23\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf3\par Maya will prepare the onboarding checklist by October 12. Jonas will review the welcome emails by October 15. The team will run a pilot with ten customers starting October 19, with a budget of EUR 12,500.\par\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs23\alang0\ab\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs23\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\b\cf3 How we will measure success\plain\rtlch\af1\afs23\alang0\acf3\ltrch\f1\fs23\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf3\par We will track setup time, support requests, and feedback from pilot customers. A weekly review will help us identify gaps and improve the experience before the wider launch.\par\par\plain\rtlch\af1\afs20\alang0\acf4\ltrch\f1\fs20\lang0\langnp0\langfe0\langfenp0\cf4 Try it: select a paragraph and choose Rephrase, or summarize the whole document with the AI Assistant. Use the gear icon in the sidebar to open Settings.\par\pard\ltrpar\itap0\nowidctlpar\ql\li0\ri0\lin0\rin0 }